{%- comment -%}
  Accepts list.single_line_text_field only (franchise / line / format).
  Never pass alterpop.character (list.metaobject_reference) here — a
  metaobject reference stringifies to "MetaobjectDrop", not its title.
  Use snippets/ap-character-names.liquid for character.

  Renders an Alterpop list-or-scalar metafield (franchise / line / format)
  as clean text. metafield.value on a list-type field returns an array —
  printing it directly stringifies to `["STAR WARS"]`. This snippet is the
  only place that ever touches metafields.alterpop.* .value for display,
  other than ap-character-names for the metaobject-reference character field.

  Params:
    value (required) — metafield.value (array or string)
    sep   (optional)  — separator between values, default ' / '
    limit (optional)  — max number of values to show, default 0 (all)
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign ap_sep = sep | default: ' / '
  assign ap_out = ''
  if value != blank
    assign ap_parts = value | join: '||' | split: '||'
    if limit != blank and limit > 0
      assign ap_parts = ap_parts | slice: 0, limit
    endif
    assign ap_out = ap_parts | join: ap_sep | strip
  endif
-%}
{{- ap_out | escape -}}
